N        EQU   16
M        EQU   4
INPUT    EQU   1000
HEAD     EQU   1050
OUT      EQU   1100
KEY      EQU   1:3
LINK     EQU   4:5
         ORIG  3000
START    ENT2  M
         STZ   HEAD,2      HEAD[p] ← Λ.
         DEC2  1
         J2P   *-2         M ≥ p ≥ 1.
         ENT1  N           j ← N.
2H       LDA   INPUT,1(KEY)
         MUL   =M(1:3)=    rA ← ⌊M·Kj/BYTESIZE^3⌋.
         STA   *+1(1:2)
         ENT4  0           rI4 ← rA.
         ENT3  HEAD+1-INPUT,4  q ← LOC(HEAD[rA]).
         LDA   INPUT,1     K ← Kj.
         JMP   4F          Jump to set p.
3H       CMPA  INPUT,2(KEY)
         JLE   5F          Jump to insert, if K ≤ KEY(p).
         ENT3  0,2         q ← p.
4H       LD2   INPUT,3(LINK)  p ← LINK(q).
         J2P   3B          Jump if not end of list.
5H       ST1   INPUT,3(LINK)  LINK(q) ← LOC(Rj).
         ST2   INPUT,1(LINK)  LINK(LOC(Rj)) ← p.
6H       DEC1  1
         J1P   2B          N ≥ j ≥ 1.
         ENT5  0
         ENT4  1
NEXTL    LD1   HEAD,4(LINK)
         J1Z   ENDL
WALK     LDA   INPUT,1(KEY)
         STA   OUT,5
         INC5  1
         LD1   INPUT,1(LINK)
         J1P   WALK
ENDL     INC4  1
         CMP4  =M=
         JLE   NEXTL
         HLT
         END   START
